{
  "$comment": [
    "Contrast contract for the product surfaces (/app + /dashboard).",
    "",
    "Pairs are declared by CSS CUSTOM PROPERTY NAME, not by literal colour. The gate",
    "resolves each name against the real .theme-weeber / .theme-weeber.dark blocks in",
    "packages/web/src/web/styles.css at run time, following var() indirection. That",
    "means changing a token value in styles.css automatically re-measures here — the",
    "contract cannot silently drift away from the stylesheet.",
    "",
    "floor: 4.5 = body text (WCAG AA)",
    "floor: 3   = large text, UI boundaries, icons, focus rings",
    "A token used as an INPUT or CONTROL border must reach 3, even if it is also used",
    "as a decorative divider elsewhere. That is the whole reason --border is split into",
    "--border / --border-control in Phase B.",
    "",
    "Marketing (.marketing scope) is deliberately NOT covered: it is out of scope for",
    "the current implementation plan and would make this gate red for reasons nobody is",
    "working on. Add its pairs when marketing comes into scope (Phase H)."
  ],
  "cssFile": "packages/web/src/web/styles.css",
  "scopes": {
    "light": ".theme-weeber",
    "dark": ".theme-weeber.dark"
  },
  "pairs": [
    {
      "label": "body text on page",
      "fg": "--foreground",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "body text on card",
      "fg": "--card-foreground",
      "bg": "--card",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "muted text on page",
      "fg": "--muted-foreground",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "muted text on card",
      "fg": "--muted-foreground",
      "bg": "--card",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "muted text on muted fill",
      "fg": "--muted-foreground",
      "bg": "--muted",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "primary button label on primary fill",
      "fg": "--primary-foreground",
      "bg": "--primary",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "sidebar text on sidebar",
      "fg": "--sidebar-foreground",
      "bg": "--sidebar",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "sidebar active-pill text on pill fill",
      "fg": "--sidebar-accent-foreground",
      "bg": "--sidebar-accent",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "accent text on accent fill",
      "fg": "--accent-foreground",
      "bg": "--accent",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "secondary text on secondary fill",
      "fg": "--secondary-foreground",
      "bg": "--secondary",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "CONTROL BORDER (input) on page",
      "fg": "--input",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "CONTROL BORDER (input) on card",
      "fg": "--input",
      "bg": "--card",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "CONTROL BORDER (input) on muted fill",
      "fg": "--input",
      "bg": "--muted",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "focus ring on page",
      "fg": "--ring",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "focus ring on card",
      "fg": "--ring",
      "bg": "--card",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "sidebar focus ring on sidebar",
      "fg": "--sidebar-ring",
      "bg": "--sidebar",
      "floor": 3
    },
    {
      "label": "status: success text on page",
      "fg": "--weeber-success",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "status: warning text on page",
      "fg": "--weeber-warning",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "status: error text on page",
      "fg": "--weeber-error",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "status: error text on card",
      "fg": "--weeber-error",
      "bg": "--card",
      "floor": 4.5
    },
    {
      "label": "destructive text on page",
      "fg": "--destructive",
      "bg": "--background",
      "floor": 4.5
    }
  ]
}
